{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】本港地區今日(10月17日)天氣預測，大致多雲。早晚有一兩陣雨，日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p>\n<p>展望重陽節早上大致多雲，有一兩陣微雨，稍後至下週初漸轉天晴乾燥。下周中期日間炎熱。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T23:39:13.636654+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T23:16:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:37.538139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:37.538139+00:00","content_hash":"7a7fda5bd0fbdd6dc93719613c1bc639f6ccf4a033d4e173464eacedd4488d33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}